nftconf (1.0.0) testing; urgency=medium

  * Declarative nftables tool with live reconcile (load/unload/status/check).
  * Daemon with inotify reload and pidfile single-instance guard.
  * NAT, whitelist/shield, multi-NIC and multi-address context scopes.
  * convert to consolidated nftables.d/*.nft.
  * AsciiDoctor man pages (localized) and info manual (DocBook→Texinfo).
  * Markdown guide.md; README and README-zh overhaul.
  * Bash completion for subcommands and conflict flags.
  * gettext translations for CLI help strings (LINGUAS).
  * Docker Compose demo lab under demo/ for NAT/whitelist/daemon/pidfile.

